"proposals - we hope to see you at {event_name} as an attendee instead\n"
"of a speaker!\n"
"\n"
"The {event_name} organisers"
msgstr ""
"Zdravíme.\n"
"\n"
"Je nám líto, ale vaši přihlášku „{submission_title}“ na událost {event_name}"
